cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "Verification scripts for: Quantum rigidity of prime-order circulants via two-basepoint Terwilliger algebras"
abstract: >-
  Exact-arithmetic verification of the computational claims of the paper
  "Quantum rigidity of prime-order circulants via two-basepoint Terwilliger
  algebras": the four capture certificates, the confinement lemma and the
  quadratic threshold p > (k-1)(k-2)+2, the saturation of the two-basepoint
  module for all 214 pairs (p,E) with p <= 250, and the capture depths of
  Appendix A recomputed from scratch in exact integer arithmetic.
type: software
version: "v1.1"
date-released: 2026-08-31
identifiers:
